# Verify before you infer

For bugs that depend on DB or environment state:

1. State the hypothesis.
2. Provide read-only checks (SQL `SELECT`, logs, API) — run yourself when credentials exist.
3. Implement only after results match.

Skip only for pure logic bugs or when the user already pasted proof.
